            <ArticleTitle>[Rare complication of a late abortion: a case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>504-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a young woman who presented with acute abdomen at our hospital. The control revealed the presence of fetal parts in extra-uterin and intra-abdominal place after a late abortion. The patient was succesfully operated by celioscopy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
